Unreleased

0.1.0-alpha.4
  - Wait for new recordings to stop growing and verify FTP transfer size.
  - Validate converted video before caching it and retry legacy header-only copies.
  - Create and clean up temporary recording directories off the event loop.

0.1.0-alpha.3
  - Added native async optical zoom and manual focus coroutines to FoscamCamera:
    - Optical zoom: zoom(direction, travel_time), zoom_stop()
    - Manual focus: focus(direction, travel_time), focus_stop()
  - Added cancellation-safe execution across all timed movement actions (ptz, zoom, focus) using try ... finally blocks to ensure motor movement stops if a task is cancelled
  - Added CLI commands:
    - zoom [in|out|stop] [-t travel_time]
    - focus [near|far|stop] [-t travel_time]
  - Documented zoom and focus commands in README.md
  - Added unit test coverage for zoom, focus, and stop handling in tests/test_client.py

0.1.0-alpha.2
  - Added native async hardware control coroutines to FoscamCamera:
    - Sleep / privacy mode: is_asleep(), sleep(), wake_up()
    - Physical status LED: get_led_state(), set_led_state()
    - Video orientation: get_flip_and_mirror(), set_flip(), set_mirror()
    - Night vision infrared: get_infra_led_config(), set_infra_led_config(), open_infra_led(), close_infra_led(), set_infra_led()
    - Audio volume & mute: get_volume(), set_volume(), get_voice_state(), set_voice_state(), get_speak_volume(), set_speak_volume()
    - White light / spotlight: open_white_light(), close_white_light(), get_white_light_brightness()
    - Siren alarm: get_siren_config(), set_siren_config()
  - Added get_full_state() to query all alarms and hardware controls concurrently via asyncio.gather with safe error handling for unsupported endpoints
  - Enhanced CLI 'status' command to display alarms, privacy/sleep state, status LED, night vision, flip/mirror orientation, volume, and mute status
  - Added dedicated CLI control subcommands: sleep, wake, led, volume, mute, ir, flip, mirror
  - Refactored CLI Home Assistant options into a pure boolean flag (--hass) and an explicit directory argument (--hass-dir), eliminating argv preprocessing workarounds
  - Expanded unit test suite to 25 automated tests covering all new client methods and CLI options

0.1.0-alpha.1
  - Initial alpha release of modernized pyfoscam library and CLI
  - Native asyncio-first core using direct aiohttp CGI communication
  - Encapsulated FTP engine with asyncio.to_thread offloading
  - Persistent local disk caching for historical recordings
  - Fast lossless AVI-to-MP4 remuxing and duration probing with asyncio subprocesses
  - Local media storage retention pruning
  - CLI commands: config, info, status, snapshot, stream, ptz, preset, motion, media (list, download, sync, prune, clear-cache)
